{"type": "tool_result", "toolName": "wren_run_sql", "toolCallId": "call_00_w9aCP5qqp4NbYKrlQncy6186", "requestId": "4438c73a-f34e-4232-adf3-95936397b702", "runId": "b6dfa1f2-742", "seq": 141, "toolResult": "\"## wren 语义查询结果\\n\\n**知识库：** wren-gap-live-20261006-233059（group_id: `73b26360-df5c-497e-9137-bdfe7f50df67`）\\n\\n**查询问题：** 统计订单表中客户为空（customer_id 为 NULL）或客户不存在（无法关联 customer 表）的订单数量\\n\\n**SQL 语句：**\\n```sql\\nWITH o AS (\\n  SELECT order_id, customer_id\\n  FROM order\\n)\\nSELECT\\n  COUNT(*) AS total_orders,\\n  SUM(CASE WHEN o.customer_id IS NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS null_customer_orders,\\n  SUM(CASE WHEN o.customer_id IS NOT NULL AND c.customer_id IS NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS unknown_customer_orders,\\n  SUM(CASE WHEN o.customer_id IS NULL OR c.customer_id IS NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS abnormal_orders\\nFROM o\\nLEFT JOIN customer c ON o.customer_id = c.customer_id\\n```\\n\\n**查询结果：**\\n\\n| total_orders | null_customer_orders | unknown_customer_orders | abnormal_orders |\\n|---|---|---|---|\\n| 12 | 1.0 | 1.0 | 2.0 |\\n\\n**数据文件：** data/df272edfb5b2.csv（1 行 × 4 列；run_python 中 pd.read_csv('data/df272edfb5b2.csv') 读取）\\n\""}
